<title>UK: WH Smith up on SBC Warburg upgrade.</title>
<headline>WH Smith up on SBC Warburg upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in retailer W.H. Smith Group Plc advanced on Friday after SBC Warburg upgraded the stock from a &quot;hold&quot; to a &quot;trading buy&quot;, dealers said.</p>
<p>Sources said the upgrade came on the back of the stock's recent underperformance.</p>
<p>The shares were up 7p at 452-1/2p by 0955 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
